# AI Policy (RealmsRPG)

AI agents (Cursor and Grok bots) must follow the ClickUp wiki page **[Using AI at Realms](https://app.clickup.com/8631005/v/dc/8cqwdmc-517)** and the [Realms Dev Workflow & Agent Rules](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1F6iZUKP9nN0YTFzOkZ6Y82sySaw0iW101f_a-7ZeQdI/edit) §6.2.

**Never generate:** art, images, creative names, item names, feat renames, plot, lore, or flavor text.

**May do:** fix grammar (unless deliberate style), implement code best practice, flag inconsistencies, technical writing, documentation.
